(T84 HIGH-PRESSURE FLUSHING AFTER THREADING)
(T85 LOW-PRESSURE FLUSHING BEFORE EACH SKIM PASS)
(WIRE-CENTRE PATH - NO WIRE OFFSET G41 G42 IS USED)
